  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity-building health procurement for Ukraine - Dutch suppliers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project provides technical support to the State Enterprise &#x201c;Medical Procurement of Ukraine&#x201d; (MPU) with the development of digital material and short digital trainings on Ukrainian&#x2019;s public medical procurement for potential suppliers. The projects delivers:&#x2022;	A professional video series guiding potential suppliers - both domestic and international - on how to engage with Ukraine&#x2019;s public medical procurement system. The videos will explain centralised procurement procedures, electronic catalog (Prozorro Market), and regulatory onboarding for new market entrants. &#x2022;	A series of targeted webinars on centralised procurement processes, regulatory requirements, and participation in Ukrainian tenders (incl. Prozorro Market). In doing so, the project strengthens the transparency of public medical procurement, improves supplier&#x2019;s engagement with the healthcare system; supports resilient supply chains in Ukraine&apos;s healthcare sector; and facilitates market entry for new suppliers, in particular small- and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs).</narrative>
  </description>
